The path-selection brain (package brain), the simulator (package sim), the
local switchboard (package switchboard), the share-link/catalogue loader
(package catalogue), the wires (package wire: VLESS with Vision and XUDP,
Trojan, VMess, the REALITY client, WebSocket, gRPC and XHTTP) and the
reference CLI (cmd/farvater) are original works of this project. Xray-core
served as the protocol reference for the wires; none of its code is linked
into the compiled binary.

