------------------------------------------------------------------------------
github.com/sagernet/sing — NOT linked
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Xray-core's transport package, which the tests run, references a small
socket-control helper API under the import path
github.com/sagernet/sing/common/control. The upstream sing project
is GPL-licensed, so this repository does NOT use it. The directory
third_party/sing-shim is an independent, clean-room implementation of only the
tiny API surface actually referenced, under the Apache License 2.0, and is
substituted at build time via a `replace` directive in go.mod. No GPL- or
AGPL-licensed code is linked into farvater-core. This is enforced in CI by
tools/licensegate.sh.

No GPL or AGPL code is compiled into this product.
